{"id":"vod_jy_67710","vodId":"67710","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"高智能方程式赛车 新世紀GPX","name_cn":"高智能方程式赛车 新世紀GPX","date":"1991-01-01","year":"1991","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第37集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/0adbfc15ded7e9d183c206ecf5681b15.jpg"},"summary":"2015年，配以电脑为导航系统的赛车比赛-Cyber Formula，取代了F1（一级方程式）成为21世纪世界最高水平的赛车赛事。14岁的少年风见隼人在护送父亲生前设计的赛车“阿斯拉”（ASURADA）到日本富士冈赛车场途中受到不知名的攻击，危急之下被迫驾驶“阿斯拉”，却因此被系统记录为唯一赛车手，不得不与职业赛车手新条直辉、布里德•加贺、卡尔•里婿特•冯•兰德尔等人一起角逐新世纪的赛车冠军。一站站的赛车比赛，不仅有赛车手之间的竞争，更有与青梅竹马菅生明日香之间的羁绊，风见隼人从此展开了新世纪GPX史上最年轻的冠军传说。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-28 10:50:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":31,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QeZj5MEe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/qaQ4Vzqe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/rb2V60jb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/lejDyrzb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/5eV61EBe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/1aK4MnJb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9aA4y5pe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/mepMGAra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/YerOKwWa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Xe0Q4xVa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/BeX43W8e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QeZj5j8e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第19集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/qaQ4VwZe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/DdwWP3gd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第21集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/DbD4BgAb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第22集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdyYRjzd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第23集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/lejDy1Yb/inde